TITLE Calcite kinetics in acidic solution; report SI Witherite at step 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 30
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -head Step SI_Witherite
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, SI("Witherite")
END
